("i2_soln","Iodine solution (in KI)","I2","aq","brown",{"sol":1000.0,"note":"0.05 M I2 in 10 % KI; blue-black with starch, decolourised by thiosulphate/ascorbate/SO2, brown -> purple with ammonia vapour; Lugol's 5 % is the iodine test for starch in a leaf"}),
