("ethene","Ethene (ethylene)","C2H4","g","colourless",{"mp":-169.2,"bp":-103.7,"den":0.00126,"odour":"faint sweet etherish","cas":"74-85-1","danger":2,"note":"from ethanol + excess hot concentrated H2SO4 at 170 C (at 140 C you get ether instead - the temperature controls the product, a superb realism point); decolourises bromine water and Baeyer's reagent, burns smoky, ripens fruit"}),
